  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda: Business acceleration for young entrepreneurs in the film sector &#x2018;Opportunities Are Here&#x2019; (OAH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This new &quot;Opportunities are Here&quot; project will provide young talents in front of and behind the camera with tailored mentoring, networking opportunities and media exposure, and generate new trade capacity and export opportunities in the film sector in Uganda. The project is an incubator of talents, making training on the film industry available, and giving beneficiaries the opportunity to acquire competencies and gain competitive advantage in the marketplace, to identify business opportunities and to market and export their creative talent locally, regionally and internationally.</narrative>
  </description>
